Constant BASE_DIR:
- anchor local file roots to the backend repo

Class Settings:
- load .env and process environment variables
- expose app, database, S3, auth, model-routing, benchmark-local-root, and provider API config
- keep secrets as SecretStr
- provide is_local helper for reload behavior
- expose all_models_list so local evaluation can read one comma-separated model matrix from .env

Function get_settings:
- cache one Settings instance per process
